#: ../../tools/dataverse_tools.rst:32 5497092e55ac473e963295773a76b6fd
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed metadata for a specific Harvard Dataverse "
"dataset by its persistent DOI identifier. Returns comprehensive "
"information including dataset ID, version details, citation metadata "
"(title, authors, description, subjects, keywords), terms of use, and "
"publication dates. The persistent ID is the DOI from search results "
"(e.g., 'doi:10.7910/DVN/DUWBBU'). Use Dataverse\\_search\\_datasets first"
" to find the global\\_id, then pass it here as persistentId."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/dataverse_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/dataverse_tools.rst:65
#: 633eb835b3ef41de91884c7aea1114cb 84bb243dfc1b478fa0d121c56470a9bb
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/dataverse_tools.rst:36 d55406980ca34c7a8346756c00525ca3
msgid ""
"``persistentId`` (string) (required) Persistent DOI identifier for the "
"dataset (e.g., 'doi:10.7910/DVN/DUWBBU', 'doi:10.7910/DVN/A6RYXI'). Found"
" in global\\_id field of search results."
msgstr ""

